Error: Jet.DestructureShapeMismatch: `Point { … }` can only destructure a `Point` value, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> Tests/UI/destructure_non_struct.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     Point{x}: 5
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Destructuring with `{ }` pulls fields out of a struct value
 Fix: Destructure a `Point`, or bind the whole value with a name
